---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What is included in the free SEO audit?',
    a: 'Indexation status. Mobile usability. Core Web Vitals scores. Google Business Profile review. Three prioritised quick wins you can implement today. Delivered via email within 48 hours.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How does the free audit compare to the paid audit?',
    a: 'The free audit is an automated snapshot covering five key areas. The paid audit at £497 is a comprehensive manual analysis covering technical SEO, content quality, backlinks, local SEO, and competitor benchmarking. It comes with a detailed PDF report and a 30-minute walkthrough call.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you need access to my website?',
    a: 'No. The free audit runs using publicly available data from your live website. No CMS access, Google Search Console, or Google Analytics required.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is there any obligation after receiving the free audit?',
    a: 'None. No cost. No strings. No unsolicited follow-up. If you want to discuss findings or explore a full audit, we are here. Otherwise, the report is yours to use as you see fit.',
  },
];

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Free SEO Audit Birmingham',
  description: 'Free SEO health check for Birmingham businesses covering indexation, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, Google Business Profile, and quick wins.',
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'SEO Birmingham',
    url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk',
    sameAs: [],
    areaServed: {
      '@type': 'City',
      name: 'Birmingham',
      containedInPlace: { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'West Midlands' },
    },
  },
  serviceType: 'Free SEO Audit',
  areaServed: {
    '@type': 'City',
    name: 'Birmingham',
    containedInPlace: { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'West Midlands' },
  },
  offers: {
    '@type': 'Offer',
    price: '0',
    priceCurrency: 'GBP',
    availability: 'https://schema.org/InStock',
    description: 'Free automated SEO health check for Birmingham businesses',
  },
};

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: f.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a },
  })),
};
---

<Base
  title="Free SEO Audit Birmingham | SEO Birmingham"
  description="Free SEO audit for Birmingham businesses. Indexation, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, Google Business Profile, and 3 quick wins. Five minutes of your time. A full picture of your SEO."
  schema={[serviceSchema, faqSchema]}
  ogType="website"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>Free SEO Audit Birmingham</h1>

    <p>Five minutes of your time. A full picture of your SEO. We run a rapid health check on your Birmingham business website and deliver three actions you can implement straight away. No cost. No obligation.</p>

    <div class="quick-answer">
      <strong>Quick Answer:</strong> Submit your website below. Get a free SEO health check within 48 hours. We cover indexation status, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, Google Business Profile, and three prioritised quick wins. No cost. No obligation. No unsolicited follow-up.
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>What the Free Audit Covers</h2>

      <p>Five areas. Each one has a direct, measurable impact on whether your Birmingham business appears in search results.</p>

      <h3>Indexation Status</h3>
      <p>How many of your pages has Google indexed versus how many exist? If Google is only seeing a fraction of your content, nothing else matters until that is fixed.</p>

      <h3>Mobile Usability</h3>
      <p>Most local searches in Birmingham come from mobile devices. Your site must render correctly on smartphones. We test mobile performance and flag usability issues that cost you rankings and conversions.</p>

      <h3>Core Web Vitals</h3>
      <p>We measure speed, interactivity, and visual stability against Google's thresholds. These are a confirmed ranking factor. Slow sites lose visitors. In competitive Birmingham markets, searchers have alternatives and they use them.</p>

      <h3>Google Business Profile Review</h3>
      <p>For Birmingham businesses targeting local customers, your Google Business Profile carries as much weight as your website. We check profile completeness, category accuracy, review volume, and common configuration errors that block you from the local 3-pack.</p>

      <h3>Three Prioritised Quick Wins</h3>
      <p>Every free audit includes three specific, actionable recommendations. Not generic suggestions. Precise changes with clear instructions, selected because they deliver the highest impact for the least effort on your specific site.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What the Free Audit Does Not Cover</h2>

      <p>The free audit is an automated snapshot. It does not include:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Manual content quality review</li>
        <li>Backlink profile analysis</li>
        <li>Competitor benchmarking</li>
        <li>Detailed technical crawl of every page</li>
        <li>Keyword cannibalisation checks</li>
        <li>Walkthrough call</li>
      </ul>

      <p>For a thorough, manually reviewed audit with a full action plan, our <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">paid SEO audit</a> at £497 covers all of the above. The free audit tells you whether a deeper investigation is worth it.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who This Audit Is For</h2>

      <p>Birmingham businesses in any of these situations:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Never had an SEO audit. Need a baseline.</li>
        <li>Considering investing in SEO but want evidence of specific issues first.</li>
        <li>Just launched a new website and need a quick sanity check.</li>
        <li>A Digbeth startup, Jewellery Quarter retailer, or Colmore professional firm wanting a baseline before committing to ongoing SEO.</li>
        <li>Need to compare site health against Birmingham competitors.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Get the Audit</h2>

      <p>Fill in the form. We deliver your free SEO health check within 48 hours.</p>

      <form action="#" method="POST" class="not-prose bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mt-6 mb-8">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Full Name</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="name"
              name="name"
              required
              placeholder="Jane Smith"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Email Address</label>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="email"
              name="email"
              required
              placeholder="jane@example.co.uk"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="website" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Website URL</label>
            <input
              type="url"
              id="website"
              name="website"
              required
              placeholder="https://www.yourbusiness.co.uk"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="business_type" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1.5">Business Type</label>
            <select
              id="business_type"
              name="business_type"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white text-text focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-shadow appearance-none"
            >
              <option value="" disabled selected>Select your industry</option>
              <option value="professional-services">Professional Services (Legal, Accounting, Consulting)</option>
              <option value="retail-ecommerce">Retail and E-Commerce</option>
              <option value="hospitality">Hospitality (Restaurants, Hotels, Bars)</option>
              <option value="healthcare">Healthcare and Medical</option>
              <option value="construction-trades">Construction and Trades</option>
              <option value="manufacturing">Manufacturing and Engineering</option>
              <option value="education-training">Education and Training</option>
              <option value="technology">Technology and SaaS</option>
              <option value="property">Property and Estate Agents</option>
              <option value="events-entertainment">Events and Entertainment</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="w-full bg-brand text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors text-base cursor-pointer shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
          >
            Get the Audit
          </button>

          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted text-center mt-3">No spam. No obligation. Report delivered within 48 hours to hello@seo-birmingham.uk.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 style="color: white; margin-top: 0;">Need the Full Picture?</h2>
      <p>The free audit is a starting point. For a manual deep-dive with a detailed action plan and walkthrough call, see our paid SEO audit.</p>
      <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">Get the full audit — £497</a>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{faq.q}</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{faq.a}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Related Pages</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">SEO Birmingham</a> — full services overview</li>
        <li><a href="/services/">All SEO Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">SEO Audit Birmingham</a> — comprehensive analysis</li>
        <li><a href="/seo-pricing-birmingham/">SEO Pricing</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
